			<table style="width: 100%">
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="1">青龍</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin001.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/yonshin002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/yonshin002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin002.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">本作のもとになっている佐藤さんの作品は、キトラ古墳や高松塚古墳で見られる壁画をテーマに描かれているようです。<br />
			この青龍は胴体や首が、よく見られるデザインのものほど長くないですね。<br />
				<br />
				複雑にからんだ右後ろ脚と尻尾は、胴体とおなじ1パーツになっています。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin003.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin003.jpg" --></a><a href="img/yonshin004.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/yonshin004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin004.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin005.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin005_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin005.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">重厚感のあるブロンズ調と、造型が際立つ象牙調。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="2">朱雀</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin009.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin009.jpg" --></a><a href="img/yonshin010.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/yonshin010_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin010.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">クジャクのような尻尾を見せつける、ダイナミックなポーズ。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin011.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin011_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin011.jpg" --></a><a href="img/yonshin012.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/yonshin012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin012.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">絵画の裏側をどう表現するのか、というのが原型師の腕の見せ所。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="3">白虎</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin006.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin006_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin006.jpg" --></a><a href="img/yonshin007.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/yonshin007_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin007.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">細身で長い首を持つ白虎。<br />
				腹は青龍と同じく、蛇のような節のあるデザインとなっています。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin008.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin008.jpg" --></a><a href="img/yonshin013.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/yonshin013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin013.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">前脚を一歩出した、動きのあるポーズ。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="4">玄武</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin014.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin014.jpg" --></a><a href="img/yonshin015.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/yonshin015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin015.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">蛇と絡み合う亀。この亀、耳がありますね。
				</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin016.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin016.jpg" --></a><a href="img/yonshin017.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/yonshin017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin017.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/yonshin018.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/yonshin018_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/shinju_yonshin/img/yonshin018.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">シルエットが美しいです。</td></tr>
